fixture coin_seed_2
doc docs/adr/0015, determinism: the same inputs and Votive as coin_seed_1 on seed 2: its coins fall tails, tails, heads. The third coin stuns a dummy the finisher has just staggered (the poise break comes first, as the hit lands before its proc): the stun is counted and the stagger's 30 frames hold, the longer of the two.
seed 2
room test/dummy
option votive_test_coin 1
frames 50
input
  0 attack
  7 attack
  14 attack
end
expect
  at 2 event.proc=1 event.stun=0 enemy.state=idle
  at 9 event.proc=1 event.stun=0 enemy.state=idle
  at 17 event.proc=1 event.stun=1 enemy.state=stagger
  during 17..48 enemy.state=stagger
end
